# Ship the final policies. The `*.pt` / `*.onnx` rules above exist to keep the
# 31-checkpoint training ladder out of git, but the hand-picked finals under
# checkpoints/ are meant to be here — see checkpoints/README.md.
!checkpoints/**/*.pt
!checkpoints/**/*.onnx
